{"game": "palworld", "language": "english", "appid": 1623730, "month": "2025-08", "window": 1, "start_date": 1754006400, "end_date": 1754611199, "month_true_total": 1477, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 16:59:07 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "201670417", "author": {"steamid": "76561198032600563", "personaname": "Vulpes", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Zygadenus/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 129543, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 5518, "playtime_at_review": 41998, "last_played": 1791385048, "avatar": "75f2c5b7b4703924a10b532283b33c1288593116"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is the game that another particular company refused to produce for you. On top of the game with all the features you asked for, you can host the game server yourself. You can modify features and sandbox any attributes. There are no restrictions if you cannot play with other players. There are no restrictions if you cannot connect online. There are no micro-transactions and I pray none exist in the future. This game still has plenty of other features I have yet to explore. That other particular company seems exclusively rampant to snuff out every flambelle about this game. If anything I support this game due to the principle of defiance.\r\n", "timestamp_created": 1754610702, "timestamp_updated": 1754610702, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1705651175", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "201669220", "author": {"steamid": "76561198118854341", "personaname": "YourFriendKirby", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198118854341/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 42296, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 33215, "last_played": 1786067656, "avatar": "8dfe278c7493b6984540e57ecd57b791df13841e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great kill time game", "timestamp_created": 1754609118, "timestamp_updated": 1754609118, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1705651175", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "201667844", "author": {"steamid": "76561198114609184", "personaname": "Krombopulos Michael", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198114609184/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 19771, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 14390, "last_played": 1757455683, "avatar": "e9335eeb4c40546e35f52aca0611ae0609bf992e"}, "language": "english", "review": "no story, no real multiplayer aspect. it's just a Material grinding game, with excessive base building (with no real purpose). all end game content is just a massive cheesing game mechanics, and Grinding dumb mechanics that no one other than people who are getting paid would do. friend bought this for me, but i wish he hadn't", "timestamp_created": 1754607298, "timestamp_updated": 1754607298, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.450000017881393433", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1705651175", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "201667464", "author": {"steamid": "76561198026851089", "personaname": "malpractice68", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198026851089/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 6473, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1988, "last_played": 1758480807, "avatar": "e8ad3c3c85f27484d2432a893410f1d10a5908ce"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fun game, although it does end up being an exercise in inventory management once you get going.  It could use some quality of life improvements like auto-dump matching items from my inventory into the chest I'm looking in.  Better yet, auto-dump items into the relevant chest in my current base area.\r\n\r\nIt's sort of like Conan Exiles, except with cute fuzzies.", "timestamp_created": 1754606881, "timestamp_updated": 1754606881, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1705651175", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "201666861", "author": {"steamid": "76561197999387040", "personaname": "melkor220", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197999387040/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 20883, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 14024, "last_played": 1787900083, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "[:\r\n", "timestamp_created": 1754606114, "timestamp_updated": 1754606114, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1705651175", "reactions": []}]}